            "source_format": "SEC_HTML",
            "printed_page": 22,
            "page": null,
            "text": "Greater China net sales decreased during 2024 compared to 2023 due primarily to lower net sales of iPhone and iPad. The weakness in the renminbi relative to the U.S. dollar had an unfavorable year-over-year impact on Greater China net sales during 2024.",
